      "content": "Wait, you just said plain dextromethorphan was safer? But literally in the last message you said dextromethorphan was what causes the serotonin syndrome with my sertraline... i'm so confused. If it causes the syndrome, why would you just tell me to take it as a single ingredient? Isn't that exactly what you just said not to do?",
